# -*- encoding: utf-8 -*-
# Arc: StoryBeginnings | Scene: TheInsidePathBegins

translate es strings:

    old "Sarah, instinctively, pulls herself physically away from Kate."
    new "Sarah, instintivamente, se aparta físicamente de Kate."

    old "She looks at her old friend. Her brown eyes seem almost black in the dark. Within them, she sees something break."
    new "Mira a su vieja amiga. Sus ojos marrones parecen casi negros en la oscuridad. Dentro de ellos, ve algo romperse."

    old "Sarah...please..."
    new "Sarah... por favor..."

    old "Sarah shakes her head."
    new "Sarah sacude la cabeza."

    old "It doesn't matter if I'm in danger here, Kate. Thomas needs me, he always did, but now more than ever."
    new "No importa si estoy en peligro aquí, Kate. Thomas necesita a mi lado, siempre lo ha necesitado, pero ahora más que nunca."

    old "If you think that I'm going to leave him alone...then you don't really know me at all."
    new "Si crees que voy a dejarlo solo... entonces no me conoces en absoluto."

    old "I will stay here, even if it means risking my life."
    new "Me quedaré aquí, incluso si significa arriesgar mi vida."

    old "Kate climbs off the bed."
    new "Kate baja de la cama."

    old "Then you're an idiot. You don't know anything about the dangers of this world."
    new "Entonces eres un idiota. No sabes nada sobre los peligros de este mundo."

    old "There will be a day when you wish you took my hand, and when that day comes, remember that I offered, and it was you who declined."
    new "Habrá un día en el que desearás haber tomado mi mano, y cuando llegue ese día, recuerda que yo ofrecí, y fue tú quien lo rechazó."

    old "Sarah steels herself and looks at Kate."
    new "Sarah se pone firme y mira a Kate."

    old "I've said my part. Get out before I have you dragged out by the guards."
    new "He dicho mi parte. Sal de aquí antes de que los guardias te arrastren."

    old "Kate shakes her head in disbelief. She pauses for a moment, trying to find the words, but finds none."
    new "Kate sacude la cabeza en incredulidad. Pausa un momento, tratando de encontrar las palabras, pero no halla ninguna."

    old "Kate turns and walks towards the door in large strides."
    new "Kate da la vuelta y se dirige a la puerta con grandes zancadas."

    old "As she opens the door, she stands in the opening and turns around, looking at Sarah one last time."
    new "Al abrir la puerta, se queda en el umbral y gira para mirar a Sarah por última vez."

    old "Sarah sees that, again, Kate has no words."
    new "Sarah ve que, otra vez, Kate no tiene palabras."

    old "Kate slips out the door, closing it softly, and vanishes."
    new "Kate se desliza por la puerta, la cierra con suavidad y desaparece."

    old "Sarah tries to get back to sleep, but her thoughts keep her awake."
    new "Sarah intenta volver a dormir, pero sus pensamientos la mantienen despierta."

    old "She wonders if she will ever see her old friend again."
    new "Se pregunta si volverá a ver a su vieja amiga alguna vez."

    old "Eventually, exhaustion carries Sarah off to sleep."
    new "Finalmente, el agotamiento lleva a Sarah al sueño."
